<title>ITALY: Italian M2 rose avge 9.4 pct in qtr end-June.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 rose avge 9.4 pct in qtr end-June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 rose an adjusted average 9.4 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-June compared with an average growth of 8.9 percent in the three months to end-May, the Bank of Italy said in a statement.</p>
</text>
